            <h2>Class time goes to <em>your</em> questions</h2>

                <section class="why-it-helps-layout">
            <div class="box">
             <img src="/images/raised-hand.svg" alt="speak">
            <h3>Speak up without the presence</h3>
             <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Officia sunt eveniet ullam?</p>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
            <img src="/images/rising-bars.svg" alt="see">
            <h3>See what the class really needs</h3>
            <p>Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Quasi tempora, repellendus pariatur fugit officiis, amet autem inventore quia laudantium earum quas.</p>
